Package: rblat
Type: Package
Title: In-Process BLAT Sequence Alignment
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Robert", "Scharpf", email = "rscharpf@jhu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs the BLAT (BLAST-Like Alignment Tool) engine entirely within R
    via a compiled C backend, with no system() calls to an external blat binary.
    The vendored BLAT sources (Jim Kent; djhshih/blat fork) are linked directly
    into the package shared library and driven through .Call entry points.
    Intended as an in-process replacement for the command-line blat step used by
    the 'trellis' package.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
Imports:
    methods,
    utils
Suggests:
    Biostrings,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
